(a) If the city deems it necessary to conduct an audit of the records and books of the licensee, the licensee shall be notified of the date, time and place of the audit. The city may designate the city's internal auditor or other designated person to perform any audit authorized in this ordinance. The licensee shall cooperate with the audit or an license(s) issued under this chapter will be subject to suspension or revocation.
